## Шаг 6 — Починить права после restore

После `--no-privileges` пользователи теряют права на таблицы. Выполнять на `app-esmp-db-test`.

```bash
# helpme — для cp-app
sudo -u postgres psql -d helpme -c "
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO helpme;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA public TO helpme;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO portal;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA public TO portal;
"

# otrs_rt — для sm-otrs
sudo -u postgres psql -d otrs_rt -c "
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO otrs;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA public TO otrs;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA report TO otrs;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA report TO otrs;
"
```

