## Шаг 7 — Обновить materialized views в otrs_rt

```bash
for VIEW in \
  "public.std_eav_customer_users" \
  "public.std_new_eav_customer_users" \
  "public.custom_eav_customer_users" \
  "public.custom_new_eav_customer_users" \
  "public.customer_user_phone" \
  "public.group_worktrip" \
  "public.std_eav_customer_companies" \
  "public.std_new_eav_customer_companies" \
  "report.dashboard_paip_analysts" \
  "report.dashboard_paip_analysts_2" \
  "report.mv_cust_rep_j" \
  "report.mv_rep_010125_extended" \
  "report.n_dash_modification"; do
    echo "REFRESH: $VIEW"
    sudo -u postgres psql -d otrs_rt -c "REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW ${VIEW};"
done
```

> Выполнять строго по одной — некоторые views зависят от предыдущих.

