## Шаг 11 — Снять блокировку почты (после тестов)

```bash
for HOST in app-esmp-sm-test app-esmp-mt-test; do
  ssh $HOST "sudo iptables -D OUTPUT -p tcp --dport 25 -j DROP && \
             sudo iptables -D OUTPUT -p tcp --dport 587 -j DROP"
done

# Вернуть DISABLE_MAIL=0
ssh app-esmp-sm-test "sudo sed -i 's/DISABLE_MAIL=1/DISABLE_MAIL=0/' /opt/esmp/sm/.env"
ssh app-esmp-sm-test "cd /opt/esmp/sm && sudo docker compose restart sm-otrs-webapp-1"
```

